{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1350880-mech-units-gundam-in-owod","id":1350880,"title":"Mech Units/Gundam in oWoD","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-11-25T12:32:14-08:00","id":1350880,"title":"Mech Units/Gundam in oWoD","content":"How do you simulate them in a chronicle? Systems, stats, etc.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Jade Kingdom Warrior","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25523-shakanaka","name":"Shakanaka","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25523_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"951"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-25T14:10:51-08:00","id":1350909,"title":"","content":"M20 is a solid base for this. Just use the vehicle rules to scale up a Technocratic Hardsuit (which is power armor instead of a full Mech).... and you're basically in this territory.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-27T06:59:30-08:00","id":1351277,"title":"","content":"If you use them as power armor (which means, slightly bigger than a standard human), then it's totally a Technocratic exoskeleton.<br /> <br /> But, it should be noted that, using our scientific understanding, the human form is really inconvenient for a mechanical vehicle. So anything bigger than an exoskeleton is frowned upon from the scientific consensum (which means probably from the Technocracy's Paradigm too).<br /> So, if you plan on bringing a real mecha in the game (like from Patlabor-size to bigger ones) then, that's totally an Etherite field.<br /> <br /> Either way, I think both options would be vulgar in nature on Earth (but an exoskeleton could pass as coincidental in hightech areas), but could work excellently in Techomantic-based umbral realm.<br /> <br /> Hell, it would be a sight...<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/250518/Dark-Shores-Lineages--of-the-Great-Lakes\" target=\"_blank\">VTM: Dark Shores: Lineages of the Great Lakes</a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/264262/Fingers-of-the-Eldest-Bogatyri\" target=\"_blank\">VTM: Fingers of the Eldest: Bogatyri</a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/295115/Forgotten-Alliances\" target=\"_blank\">WTA: Forgotten Alliances</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24483-salamander","name":"SalamanDer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24483_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"171"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}